{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1252546-suggestions-for-some-rotes","id":1252546,"title":"Suggestions for some rotes","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-09-08T10:45:51-07:00","id":1252546,"title":"Suggestions for some rotes","content":"I was wondering how to reproduce some powers I saw in games, comics and so on<br /> Give me your opinions on the spheres needed for these rotes<br /> <br /> 1) A rote that ressurrect your body after your death<br /> <br /> 2)A rote to devour the minds and the experiences of other people<br /> <br /> 3) A rote to know when and where your name has been spoken<br /> <br /> 4) A rote to know recognize truth from lies without using mind read<br /> <br /> 5) A rote to be always in time<br /> <br /> 6) A rote to transfer your consciousness on the internet <br /> <br /> 7) A rote to always know where to go to find what you desire<br /> <br /> 8) A rote to add, or remove, a news from the media or from a database","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12142-undead-rabbit","name":"Undead rabbit","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-08T15:25:54-07:00","id":1252609,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Undead rabbit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1252546-suggestions-for-some-rotes#post1252546\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I was wondering how to reproduce some powers I saw in games, comics and so on<br /> Give me your opinions on the spheres needed for these rotes</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200b<br /> As an added challenge, I am not going to look at HDYDT for advice. This will be pure sphere interpretation.<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Undead rabbit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1252546-suggestions-for-some-rotes#post1252546\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">1) A rote that ressurrect your body after your death</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200b<br /> This requires turning your body from a matter pattern back into a life pattern at the point of death.<br /> <br /> For the transformation you need Matter and Life. As this is a transformation, Life 4 minimum would be required. The level of matter would depend on how damaged the body becomes. at the point of death could be a simple Matter 2 since not much has changed. If there's a great deal of decay, however, this may go up to Matter 4 to make very specific changes.<br /> <br /> This is a contingency effect, therefore we require Time 4. Entropy 1 would also be required for the contingency effect to contain the &quot;after death&quot; clause.<br /> <br /> So, that's Life 4, Matter 2-4, Time 4, Entropy 1 for the bare minimum of post death ressurrection.<br /> <br /> If you wanted to preserve your memories then Mind 4 would be necessary to carry them across. If you wanted to keep your avatar then Prime and Spirit would be necessary. Spirit 4 and Prime 4 should be sufficient, since Spirit 4 is needed for stuffing spirits into things, and Prime 4 is required for moving around large dollops of quintesence around. But an argument can be made for requiring Spirit 5 or Prime 5 for especially powerful avatars.<br /> <br /> So at the extreme end, that's Life 4, Matter 2-4, Time 4, Entropy 1, Mind 4 Spirit 4-5, Prime 4-5<br /> <br /> \u200b<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Undead rabbit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1252546-suggestions-for-some-rotes#post1252546\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">2)A rote to devour the minds and the experiences of other people</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200b<br /> Mind 5 would be required to rend one's mind from their target's body. For the devouring part, that depends on how you mean. If you mean literally to eat it, then probably a combination of Matter 2 and Life 2 to turn it into something edible. To turn it into quintessence you would need Prime 4, as that is what is needed to rend quintesence from life patterns.<br /> \u200b<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Undead rabbit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1252546-suggestions-for-some-rotes#post1252546\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">3) A rote to know when and where your name has been spoken</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200b<br /> Without a doubt, Corr. Time and Entropy will be a core component of this spell. Corr for the where, Time for the when, and Entropy for the event of your name. Since this is all sensory stuff, I'd say 1 rank in each would suffice for such a spell<br /> <br /> \u200b<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Undead rabbit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1252546-suggestions-for-some-rotes#post1252546\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">4) A rote to know recognize truth from lies without using mind read</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200b<br /> Entropy 1 would allow that. Ring of Truth is a pretty standard rote. I'd argue how this works depends on paradigm more than anything, but I've decided to keep complications like paradigm to a minimum with something as general as these questions.<br /> \u200b<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Undead rabbit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1252546-suggestions-for-some-rotes#post1252546\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">5) A rote to be always in time</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200b<br /> That's just straight up Time 1's Perfect Time rote.<br /> \u200b<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Undead rabbit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1252546-suggestions-for-some-rotes#post1252546\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">6) A rote to transfer your consciousness on the internet</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200b<br /> You've got two options for that one. The first is going all Digital Web 2.0, grabbing some VR goggles and using Corr 2 to get online, the second is a form of astral projection, meaning it requires Mind 4. Arguably you could also do it with Spirit 3 and find the back door entrance to the internet via the spirit realm, but that would be a really roundabout way of doing it.<br /> \u200b<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Undead rabbit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1252546-suggestions-for-some-rotes#post1252546\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">7) A rote to always know where to go to find what you desire</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200b<br /> Entropy 1 should have you covered for that.<br /> \u200b<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Undead rabbit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1252546-suggestions-for-some-rotes#post1252546\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">8) A rote to add, or remove, a news from the media or from a database.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200b<br /> Uh... computer hacking skills? I need a few more details on this one to know exactly what you're asking for.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/959615-chronicle-report-keepers-of-the-wyck\" target=\"_blank\">Keepers of the Wyck: A Chronicle I'm running</a> FINALE: Chapter 39: Green Fairy","edited":{"userid":12193,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12193-saikou","user":"Saikou","date":". 09-08-2018, 06:28 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12193-saikou","name":"Saikou","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12193_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1406"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}